==English==

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
'''[[electromagnetic]] [[spectrum]]'''

# The entire [[range]] of [[wavelengths]] of all known [[electromagnetic radiation]]s extending from [[gamma rays]] through [[X-ray|X-rays]], [[visible light]], [[infrared]], and [[radio wave|radio waves]]. It is divided into 26 alphabetically designated [[bands]], having [[frequencies]] of 0 to at least 10<sup>23</sup> [[hertz]].

